config BMI323_I2C
	bool "BMI323 IMU driver (I2C fork)"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_PROTOCENTRAL_BMI323_I2C_ENABLED
	select I2C
	select SENSOR
	help
	  Local fork of the upstream Bosch BMI323 Zephyr driver with an I2C
	  bus backend. The upstream driver only supports SPI at the time of
	  writing (Zephyr 4.2). This fork uses the
	  "protocentral,bmi323-i2c" compatible to avoid clashing if upstream
	  later grows native I2C support.

	  Exposes the same sensor API channels (accel x/y/z, gyro x/y/z,
	  die temp) and the any-motion trigger.
